  "description": "A user-interface translation library for .NET: extract translatable strings from call sites, hand them to translators in standard formats (ARB, XLIFF, Portable Object), and load translations at runtime as pluggable overrides. The in-code default is always the source of truth and terminal fallback. Bundles the container-format providers; no dependencies beyond the BCL.",
